      "content": "In this scenario, the formula suggests that the speaker's stable vocal fundamental frequency has a profound impact on the audience's physiological state, significantly amplifying the predictive power of the facial symmetry ratios. The vocal resonance creates a kind of \"sensory attractor\" that draws the audience towards attentiveness and compliance, essentially overriding any limitations imposed by the lower facial symmetry. By arranging the formula's output similarly to the master sideband, you'd get tighter probability forecasting.",
